nodeId":230390101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4422,"speakerName":"Ebeid","textMapHash":108836722,"text":"#{F#Miss}{M#Mister}! Wait!","nextNodeIds":[230390102]},{"nodeId":230390102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4422,"speakerName":"Ebeid","textMapHash":4246184466,"text":"Are you... an adventurer? I mean the kind of adventurers who are skilled in battle and travel to many places.","nextNodeIds":[230390103,230390104]},{"nodeId":230390103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3791076154,"text":"You could say that.","nextNodeIds":[230390105]},{"nodeId":230390105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4422,"speakerName":"Ebeid","textMapHash":3354763266,"text":"#Look, Hilmi! I said {M#he}{F#she} must be an adventurer!","nextNodeIds":[230390106]},{"nodeId":230390106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4423,"speakerName":"Hilmi","textMapHash":101749378,"text":"But don't adventurers always wear those green outfits?","nextNodeIds":[230390107,230390108]},{"nodeId":230390107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":337766146,"text":"I'm too skilled to need that green outfit.","nextNodeIds":[230390109]},{"nodeId":230390109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4423,"speakerName":"Hilmi","textMapHash":3054179354,"text":"Wow!","nextNodeIds":[230390110]},{"nodeId":230390110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4422,"speakerName":"Ebeid","textMapHash":1489369362,"text":"Wow!","nextNodeIds":[230390111]},{"nodeId":230390111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4422,"speakerName":"Ebeid","textMapHash":2509387914,"text":"In that case, you can definitely help us!","nextNodeIds":[230390112]},{"nodeId":230390112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4422,"speakerName":"Ebeid","textMapHash":2889720402,"text":"Do you see that big warehouse in the village? Habachi said we must keep watch over it because many important things are kept there.","nextNodeIds":[230390113]},{"nodeId":230390113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4423,"speakerName":"Hilmi","textMapHash":543199250,"text":"He also told us that if any bad guys come, he'll shut down the lift and cut off the bridge.","nextNodeIds":[230390114]},{"nodeId":230390114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4422,"speakerName":"Ebeid","textMapHash":2894554890,"text":"But the lift is some distance away from the warehouse. To shut it down, Habachi will have to run really fast.","nextNodeIds":[230390115]},{"nodeId":230390115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4422,"speakerName":"Ebeid","textMapHash":2600655826,"text":"We thought we could train with him, but he's been ignoring our offer...","nextNodeIds":[230390116]},{"nodeId":230390116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4423,"speakerName":"Hilmi","textMapHash":2886274330,"text":"How I wish he could instead ignore us when we try to sneak out to skip stones! Like that's gonna happen... Hmph!","nextNodeIds":[230390117]},{"nodeId":230390117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4422,"speakerName":"Ebeid","textMapHash":1656614426,"text":"Ahem, anyway, if Habachi happens to be exhausted when the bad guys come, we'll shut down the lift for him.","nextNodeIds":[230390118]},{"nodeId":230390118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4422,"speakerName":"Ebeid","textMapHash":101240674,"text":"You're an adventurer, so you must be a fast runner, too! Please train with us.","nextNodeIds":[230390119,230390121]},{"nodeId":230390119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2606930298,"text":"Sure. Let's run together.","nextNodeIds":[230390120]},{"nodeId":230390120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4422,"speakerName":"Ebeid","textMapHash":2759419762,"text":"Yay! Thank you!","nextNodeIds":[230390126]},{"nodeId":230390126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4423,"speakerName":"Hilmi","textMapHash":4223502554,"text":"We've chosen the starting point. Let's go there!","nextNodeIds":[230390127]},{"nodeId":230390127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4423,"speakerName":"Hilmi","textMapHash":781730586,"text":"Hehe, I will be your rival. For the record, I'm a really good runner!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":230390121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":896328794,"text":"You can trust Habachi...","nextNodeIds":[230390122]},{"nodeId":230390122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4422,"speakerName":"Ebeid","textMapHash":2790649954,"text":"Play with us, please!","nextNodeIds":[230390123]},{"nodeId":230390123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4422,"speakerName":"Ebeid","textMapHash":3783428498,"text":"#Play with us, please, nice {M#Mister}{F#Miss}!","nextNodeIds":[230390124]},{"nodeId":230390124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1422055618,"text":"Okay...","nextNodeIds":[230390125]},{"nodeId":230390125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4422,"speakerName":"Ebeid","textMapHash":1846477890,"text":"Yay! Thank you!","nextNodeIds":[230390126]},{"nodeId":230390108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":713421834,"text":"I'm quite special and don't need that outfit.","nextNodeIds":[230390109]},{"nodeId":230390104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3382488506,"text":"That's sort of accurate.","nextNodeIds":[230390105]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2303901,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["4422"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBE