Ids":[230390404]},{"nodeId":230390404,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4423,"speakerName":"Hilmi","textMapHash":2881809602,"text":"Hehe, I told you how good I am! You underestimated me, didn't you?","nextNodeIds":[230390405]},{"nodeId":230390405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4422,"speakerName":"Ebeid","textMapHash":4254931154,"text":"But even if we can run this fast, we can't outrun Habachi. I just don't understand why.","nextNodeIds":[230390406,230390407]},{"nodeId":230390406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":235894026,"text":"There might be a shortcut.","nextNodeIds":[230390408]},{"nodeId":230390408,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4422,"speakerName":"Ebeid","textMapHash":2428176090,"text":"Is that so? But I don't think there's any shortcut around.","nextNodeIds":[230390409]},{"nodeId":230390409,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4423,"speakerName":"Hilmi","textMapHash":1292751930,"text":"#{F#Miss}{M#Mister}, can you play with us next time...","nextNodeIds":[230390410]},{"nodeId":230390410,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4423,"speakerName":"Hilmi","textMapHash":1773351778,"text":"I mean... train with us! Um... Let's train that \"tracking in the wilderness\" thing!","nextNodeIds":[230390411]},{"nodeId":230390411,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4422,"speakerName":"Ebeid","textMapHash":2868722386,"text":"You're right! Since we can't outrun Habachi, we can get around him...","nextNodeIds":[230390412]},{"nodeId":230390412,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4423,"speakerName":"Hilmi","textMapHash":3329176074,"text":"We tried that before, didn't we? But it never worked...","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":230390407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3081298274,"text":"He might be playing some trick.","nextNodeIds":[230390408]},{"nodeId":230390403,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3